<title>JAPAN: Hasegawa - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hasegawa - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.12		vs	    9.16</p>
<p> Operating	  402    million    vs	  374    million</p>
<p> Current	    296    million    vs	  292    million</p>
<p> Net		  129    million    vs	  101    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.00 yen	  vs	    6.63 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     16 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hasegawa Co Ltd is the largest speciality store chain operator of Buddhist altars.</p>
